OL,3,GNEWSACouncil garages need #1.2m of
OL,4,Aurgent repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority is facing a #1.2m
OL,7,Frepair bill after identifying safety
OL,8,Fdefects with nearly 250 council-owned
OL,9,Fgarages.
OL,11,FA South Kesteven District Council
OL,12,Fsurvey of 854 garages across 97 sites
OL,13,Ffound a range of problems, including
OL,14,Ffailed garage doors, a partial roof
OL,15,Fcollapse in Grantham and a wall and
OL,16,Froof collapse at a garage in Stamford.
OL,18,FOfficers said a total of 242 of the
OL,19,Fgarages were ranked as "red" ` meaning
OL,20,Furgent action was required.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
