OL,3,GNEWSACouncil garages need #1.2m of
OL,4,Aurgent repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe repair cost of #1.2m, recommended
OL,7,Fby officers, compares with #1.54m for
OL,8,Fdemolition and more than #6.6m for a
OL,9,Flike-for-like rebuild.
